       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UPPERBNK.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 WS-CUSTOMER-NAME PIC X(30).
       01 WS-CITY PIC X(20).
       01 WS-ACCOUNT-TYPE PIC X(15).
       01 WS-UPPER-NAME PIC X(30).
       01 WS-UPPER-CITY PIC X(20).
       01 WS-UPPER-TYPE PIC X(15).
       01 WS-REFERENCE PIC X(100).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "ENTER CUSTOMER NAME:"
           ACCEPT WS-CUSTOMER-NAME
           DISPLAY "ENTER CITY:"
           ACCEPT WS-CITY
           DISPLAY "ENTER ACCOUNT TYPE:"
           ACCEPT WS-ACCOUNT-TYPE
           MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(WS-CUSTOMER-NAME)
               TO WS-UPPER-NAME
           MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(WS-CITY)
               TO WS-UPPER-CITY
           MOVE FUNCTION UPPER-CASE(WS-ACCOUNT-TYPE)
               TO WS-UPPER-TYPE
           STRING
               "CUSTOMER: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               FUNCTION TRIM(WS-UPPER-NAME)
                   DELIMITED BY SIZE
               " | ACCOUNT: " DELIMITED BY SIZE
               FUNCTION TRIM(WS-UPPER-TYPE)
                   DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO WS-REFERENCE
           END-STRING
           DISPLAY "STANDARDIZED CUSTOMER RECORD"
           DISPLAY "CUSTOMER NAME: "
               FUNCTION TRIM(WS-UPPER-NAME)
           DISPLAY "CITY: "
               FUNCTION TRIM(WS-UPPER-CITY)
           DISPLAY "ACCOUNT TYPE: "
               FUNCTION TRIM(WS-UPPER-TYPE)
           DISPLAY "REFERENCE:"
           DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-REFERENCE)
           STOP RUN.